# Prism brain — git sync exclusions
#
# These paths contain local-only or sensitive content and must
# never be pushed to the shared org repository.

# ── Unprocessed queue ──────────────────────────────────────
# Raw artifacts land here before they are reviewed and promoted.
# Unprocessed files are local-only working state.
ingestion/unprocessed/

# ── Private files ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Any file whose name ends in -private.md was marked Private at
# ingest time. Keep them off the shared repo unconditionally.
**/*-private.md
